⍝ ==== s2 driver: s2c main.trh… [-o out] [--debug] [--include h] [--link f.c | -lNAME]
⍝   [--tokens | --ast | --check | --emit-llvm | --fold | --unfold n]
⍝ The dumps print what trithc prints; without one, the program is compiled as trithc does.
⍝ All the files given form one module; a module of several files, or one with a plane
⍝ header ⧉, is folded from its planes first (Addendum A.1).

⎔ $trith_write_file$ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹wfile› ⸫
⎔ $system$ ⟨⟗ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹system› ⸫

⍝ ‹streq2› a b: the strings are equal
⦃
  ⧖:a,b
  ⧗:a̱,ḇ ○ ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [a b i acc]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,b,i,acc
    ⧗:a̱,i ᛒ ⧖:x
    ⧗:a̱,ḇ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:acc ⧗:x ⧗:ḇ,i ᛒ ᛖ ⋎
    ⧗:x #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:a,b,i,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streq2› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:a,b ⧗:b̵ ⟗ ⧗:a̱ ‹streq2› ⧖:r ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streqo› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,count,rem
  ⧗:path̵ ⟗ ○ ‹ppath› ⌁̵ $: error: imbalance: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:count ᛁ $ tokens, $ ⎙̵ ⧗:rem ᛁ $ too many for the Ternary Balance Law\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹imbal› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:T,st ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:Ṯ ‹adump› ⌁̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹dumpw› ⸫

⍝ ‹astw› path toks: parse, tangle and print the item tree
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks̵ ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:st̵ ‹dumpw› ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹astw› ⸫

⍝ ‹checkw› path toks: parse, tangle and check (printing the trace), then "ok"
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks̵ ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:patẖ,st̵ △ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⌁̵ $ok\n$ ⎙̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹checkw› ⸫

⍝ ‹emitw› path toks debug: parse, tangle, check and print the LLVM IR
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks,dbg
  ⧗:toks̵ ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:patẖ,st̵ ○ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⧗:dbg ‹egen› ⌁̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹emitw› ⸫

⍝ ‹compilew› path toks mode: compile to an executable, as trithc does (5: next to the source, 6: -o)
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks,mode
  ⧗:mode #10# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:dbg
  ⧗:toks̵ ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:patẖ,st̵ ○ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⧗:dbg ‹eir› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C̵,q,mode,dbg ‹ebuild› ⌁̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹compilew› ⸫

⍝ ‹eheapstr› cps C: code points (after a sentinel) as a heap string
⦃
  ⧖:pc,C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e ○ ⧗:pc̱ ᚴ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n
    ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n ⧗:pc̱ ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:pc̱,j ᚳ ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:e ⧖:C ⌁̱ ⧗:C̵,e
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eheapstr› ⸫
⍝ ‹bargs› C: what the arguments say for the build: the output path (−1: next to the source),
⍝ the #include lines for --include, the C files of --link, and its libraries (--link -lssl)
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹qnew› ⧖:C,inc ⧗:C̵ ‹qnew› ⧖:C,lnk ⧗:C̵ ‹qnew› ⧖:C,lib
  ⧗:C̵,inc,lnk,lib #-1# △
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,inc,lnk,lib,out,i
    ⧗:i ‹argcode› ⧖:k
    ⧗:C̵,inc,lnk,lib,out,i,k ⧗:k #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹bargs1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:C,inc,lnk,lib,out ⧗:C̵,out,inc,lnk,lib
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹bargs› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,inc,lnk,lib,out,i,k
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ‹eargheap› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,out,v ⧗:k #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:o,vv ⧗:vv ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,out2
  ⧗:C̵,inc,v ⧗:k #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:q,vv %%#include "{vv}"%% ⧖:l ⧗:q,l ‹qadd› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,v #45# #108# ‹spfx2› ⧖:C,isl
  ⧗:lnk ⧗:lib ⧗:isl ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:tq
  ⧗:C̵,tq,v ⧗:k #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹qadd› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:inc,lnk,lib,out2 ⧗:i ⧗:k #6# #8# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ #2# ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹bargs1› ⸫
⍝ ‹eargheap› C i: argument i as a heap string (−1 if there is none)
⦃
  ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:oc ⌁̵ ⧖:CC ⧗:oc̵ ⟗ ⧗:CC̵ ‹eheapstr› ⧖:CC2,s ⌁̵ ⧗:CC2̵,s ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eargheap› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #6# ‹reg› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C̵,p ‹segend› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,p ⧗:n #4# ⊟ ‹sat› ⧖:C,dot
  ⧗:C̵,p ○ ⧗:n #2# ⊟ ⧗:n #4# ⊟ ⧗:dot #46# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ‹ssub›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹estripext› ⸫
⍝ ‹etextof› C s: a heap string as text
⦃ ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ »« ⧗:s ‹estext› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ʃ⟩ ‹etextof› ⸫
⍝ ‹ewrite› C path q: write the lines of q to the file path (both heap strings)
⦃
  ⧖:C,path,q
  ⧗:C̵,q »« ‹eqtext› ⧖:C,text
  ⧗:C̵,path ‹etextof› ⧖:C,pt
  ⧗:pt̵ ⟗ ⧗:text̵ ‹wfile2› ⧖:r ⌁̵
  ⧗:C̵,path ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹spr› $: error: cannot write\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ewrite› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:p,t ⧗:t̵ ⟗ ⧗:p̱ ⍿¹ ‹wfile› ⧖:r ⌁̱ ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹wfile2› ⸫
⍝ ‹esys› C cmd: run a shell command (a heap string); stop if it fails
⦃
  ⧖:C,cmd
  ⧗:C̵,cmd ‹etextof› ⧖:C,ct
  ⧗:ct̵ ⟗ ‹system› ⧖:r ⌁̵
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹esys› ⸫
⍝ ‹ebuild› C q mode dbg: write the IR (and the FFI glue), then let clang and llvm-link make the
⍝ executable: the runtime, the glue and every --link file become IR and are linked into one module
⦃
  ⧖:C,q,mode,dbg
  ⧗:C̵ ‹bargs› ⧖:C,out0,inc,lnk,lib
  ⧗:C̵,out0 ⧗:out0 #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹estripext› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C̵ %%{out}.ll%% ⧖:C,ll
  ⧗:C̵,ll,q ‹ewrite› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,inc ‹eglue› ⧖:C,gq
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:gq #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,ng
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:dbg △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ %%-O0 -g%% ⦄ ⦃ %%-O2%% ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,opt
  ⧗:C̵ %%clang -S -emit-llvm {opt} -w -I . -o {out}.c0.ll trith/runtime/trith_rt.c 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,out,gq,opt ⧗:ng ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ %%%% △ ⦄ ⦃ ‹eglueb› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,more,ci
  ⧗:C̵,lnk ‹rd› ⧖:C,nd
  ⧗:C̵,out,opt,more,ci,nd
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,out,opt,more,ci,nd
    ⧗:C̵,out,opt,more,ci,nd ⧗:nd #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹elink1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:C,out,opt,more
  ⧗:C̵ %%llvm-link -o {out}.bc {ll} {out}.c0.ll{more} 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,lib #2# ‹qjoin› ⧖:C,libs
  ⧗:C̵ %%clang {opt} -w -o {out} {out}.bc {libs} -lm 2>&1%% ‹esys›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebuild› ⸫
⍝ the FFI glue as C: written, compiled, and named for the link
⦃
  ⧖:C,out,gq,opt
  ⧗:C̵ %%{out}.ffi.c%% ⧖:C,gp
  ⧗:C̵,gp,gq ‹ewrite› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ %%clang -S -emit-llvm {opt} -w -I . -o {out}.c1.ll {gp} 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ %% {out}.c1.ll%% #2#
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹eglueb› ⸫
⍝ one --link file: compiled to IR and named for the link
⦃
  ⧖:C,out,opt,more,ci,nd
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:nd △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,src
  ⧗:C̵ %%clang -S -emit-llvm {opt} -w -I . -o {out}.c{#ci}.ll {src} 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ %%{more} {out}.c{#ci}.ll%% ⧖:C,more2
  ⧗:C̵,nd ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx
  ⧗:C̵,out,opt,more2 ⧗:ci △ ⊞ ⧗:nx
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹elink1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,mode
  ⧗:path̵,out̵,mode ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⧗:o̵ ⟗ ‹foldpr› ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹run1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹run› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,out,mode
  ⧗:path̵,out̵,mode ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ
  ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⧗:o̵ ⟗ ‹dump› ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o̵ ‹astw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
      ⦃ ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o̵ ‹checkw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
        ⦃ ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⍿¹ #14# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:d ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o̵,d ‹emitw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
          ⦃ ⧖:o,m ⟗ ⧗:o̵,m ‹compilew› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹run1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,out
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:count ⧖:out
  ⧗:count #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ #3# ⊞ ⦄ ⧖:rem
  ⧗:path̵,out̵,count,rem,mode
  ⧗:rem ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:m ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:m ‹run› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹imbal› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹main3› ⸫

⍝ ‹main2› path mode src: one file; it is a module of planes if it has a header (A.1)
⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,src
  ⧗:src̵ ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:cps ⌁̵
  ⧗:cps̵ ⟗ ‹hashdr› ⧖:planes ⧖:cps
  ○ ⧗:planes ⧗:mode #7# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:mode #999# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ #2# ⊞ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⧖:code
  ⧗:path̵,cps̵,mode,code ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹main2a› ⦄
    ⦃ ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:m ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:m ‹mainp› ⦄ ⦃ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹main2u› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main2x› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹main2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,cps,mode
  ⧗:path̵ ⟗ ⧗:cps̵ ‹lexw› ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇ ⦃ ‹main3› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main2a› ⸫
⍝ --unfold n: the file dealt over n planes (A.1.4)
⦃
  ⧖:path,cps,mode
  ⧗:path̵ ⟗ ⧗:cps̵ ‹lexw› ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹exit› ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⦄ ⧖:toks ⌁̵
  ⧗:toks̵ ⟗ ⧗:mode #1000# ⊟ ‹unfoldpr› ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main2u› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,cps,mode
  ⧗:cps̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:path̵ ⎙̵ $: error: --unfold takes a file of one plane, without a header ⧉ (A.1.4)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main2x› ⸫

⍝ ---- modules of several files (A.1)

⍝ ‹mainp› mode: every source file is lexed (into one buffer, each line holding its plane
⍝ origin), folded, and run as one module; the module's path is the files' paths, separated by U+0001
⦃
  ⧖:mode
  ‹srcpath› ⟗ ‹lexall› ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹exit› ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⦄ ⧖:toks ⧖:path
  ⧗:path̵ ⟗ ⧗:toks̵ ‹foldown› ⧖:t2 ⧖:path
  ⧗:path̵,mode,t2̵ ‹main3›
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹mainp› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:path,toks ⧗:toks̵ ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹fold› ⧖:out ⌁̵ ⧗:out̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹foldown› ⸫

⍝ ‹srcnext› i: the index of the next source file among the arguments from i, or −1
⦃
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:i
    ⧗:i ‹argcode› ⧖:k
    ⧗:i,k ⧗:k #-1# ᛖ ⧗:k ○ ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:k ⧗:k #6# #8# ᛦ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ #2# ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⍿⁰ ‹argcode› #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹srcnext› ⸫

⍝ ‹srcpath›: the source files' paths, separated by U+0001
⦃
  »« △ ‹srcnext› ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [path i first]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:path,i,first
    ⧗:path̵,i,first ⧗:i #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹srcpath1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⊸ ʃ⟩ ‹srcpath› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,i,first
  ⧗:path̵ ⧗:first ⋔ ∅ ⦃ △ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:path
  ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ »« ⦄ ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̵ ⟗ ⧗:path̵ ○ ‹scat1› ⧖:path ⌁̵
  ⧗:path̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ‹srcnext› ⊕
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ʃ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹srcpath1› ⸫
⍝ ‹scat1› b a i: a with the bytes of b from i on
⦃
  ⧖:b,a,i
  ⧗:ḇ,a̵,i
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,a,i
    ⧗:ḇ,i ᛒ ⧖:c
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:a̵ ⧗:c ⧗:c #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:c #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:a ⌁̱ ⧗:a̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ℤ ⊸ ʃ⟩ ‹scat1› ⸫

⍝ ‹lexall› path: the tokens of every source file, each file's lines holding its plane origin
⦃
  ⧖:path
  ⟦ ○ ○ ▽ ▽ ○ ▽ ○ ⟧ ⧗:patẖ △ ‹srcnext› ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [out path i f]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:out,path,i,f
    ⧗:out̵,patẖ,i,f ⧗:i #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:out,path,i,f ⧗:out̵,patẖ,i,f ‹lexsrc› ‹ok› ⧗:patẖ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ‹srcnext› ⧗:f △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lexall› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:out,path,i,f
  ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ »« ⦄ ⧖:name
  ⧗:name̵ ⟗ ᚠ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ »« ⦄ ⧖:src ⧖:name
  ⧗:src̵ ⟗ ⍴̱ ○ ᛖ ⧖:empty ⧖:src
  ⧗:name̵ ⧗:empty ⋔ ⦃ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:src̵ ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:cps ⌁̵
  ⧗:cps̵ ⟗ ⧗:out̵,patẖ △ △ ⧗:f ○ ○ ‹plpack› ‹lexinto› ⁇ ⦃ ⧖:o ⌁̵ ⧗:o̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ ↯ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lexsrc› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode
  ⧗:path̵ ⟗ ᚠ ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇
    ⦃ ⟗ ⍴̱ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
    ⦃ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main1› ⸫

⦃ $usage: s2c <main.trh>… [-o <output>] [--debug] [--include h] [--link f.c | -lNAME] [--tokens | --ast | --check | --emit-llvm | --fold | --unfold n]\n$ ⎙̵ #2# ‹exit› ⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ‹usage› ⸫

⍝ ---- arguments, as trithc reads them: flags in any order, the first other argument is the source

⍝ ‹argeq› s i: argument i is the literal s
⦃ ⧖:s,i ⧗:s̵ ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⟗ ⍿² ‹streqo› ⧖:r ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹argeq› ⸫
⍝ ‹argcode› i: −1 none, 1 --tokens, 2 --ast, 3 --check, 4 --emit-llvm, 5 --debug, 6 -o, 7 --include,
⍝ 8 --link, 9 --plough or --unplough (s1 only), 10 --fold, 11 --unfold, 0 anything else
⦃
  ⧖:i
  ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ○ ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ⦄
  $--tokens$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $--ast$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $--check$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $--emit-llvm$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $--debug$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #5# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $-o$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #6# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $--include$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #7# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $--link$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #8# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $--plough$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $--unplough$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $--fold$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ $--unfold$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #11# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹argcode› ⸫
⍝ ‹argscan›: the mode (0 compile, 7 --fold, 1000 + n --unfold n), --debug, the first source's
⍝ index (−1: none), whether the arguments are bad, and how many source files there are
⦃
  △ ○ ○ #-1# ○ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:i,mode,dbg,in,bad,ns
    ⧗:i ‹argcode› ⧖:k
    ⧗:i,mode,dbg,in,bad,ns,k ⧗:k #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹argstep› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:i,mode,dbg,in,bad,ns ⧗:mode,dbg,in,bad,ns
⦄ ⟨⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹argscan› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:i,mode,dbg,in,bad,ns,k
  ⧗:i △ ⊞ ‹argnum› ⧖:num
  ⧗:mode ⧗:k ⧗:k △ #4# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:k #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #7# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:num ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a ⌁ ⧗:a #1000# ⊞ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:mode2
  ⧗:dbg ⧗:k #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:dbg2
  ⧗:i △ ⊞ ‹argcode› ⧖:knext
  ⧗:k #6# #8# ᛦ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋏ ⧖:takes
  ⧗:in ⧗:i ⧗:k ○ ᛖ ⧗:in #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:in2
  ⧗:ns ⧗:k ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:ns2
  ⧗:bad ⧗:takes ⧗:knext #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⧗:num △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:bad2
  ⧗:i ⧗:takes ⋔ ⦃ #2# ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⊞ ⧖:i2
  ⧗:i2,mode2,dbg2,in2,bad2,ns2
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹argstep› ⸫
⍝ ‹argnum› i: argument i as a decimal number, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:i
  ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⟗ ○ ○ ⦶ ‹argnum1› ⧖:v ⌁̵ ⧗:v ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹argnum› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:s,j,v,ok
  ⧗:s̱,j,v,ok
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:s,j,v,ok
    ⧗:s̱,j ᛒ ⧖:c
    ⧗:s̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:v,ok,c ⧗:c #-1# ᛖ
    ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:c ⧖:o ⧖:v ⧗:v #10# ⊠ ⧗:c #48# ⊟ ⊞ ⧗:o ⧗:c #48# #57# ᛦ ⋎ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:s,j,v,ok
  ⧗:v ⧗:j #2# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⧗:ok ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹argnum1› ⸫
⍝ ‹main0› mode dbg in ns: the run's mode (5 compile; +10 with --debug for --emit-llvm and
⍝ compiling); a module of several files goes through ‹mainp›
⦃
  ⧖:mode,dbg,in,ns
  ⧗:mode ⧗:mode ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #5# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:m
  ⧗:m ⧗:m #4# ᛖ ⧗:m #5# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:dbg △ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #10# ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:fm
  ⧗:fm,in ⧗:ns △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹mainp› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:f,i ⧗:f ⧗:i ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⧖:p ⧖:f ⧗:p̵,f ‹main1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹usage› ⦄ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main0› ⸫

⦃
  ‹argscan› ⧖:mode,dbg,in,bad,ns
  ⧗:mode,dbg,in,ns ⧗:in #-1# ᛖ ⧗:bad △ ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹usage› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main0› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
